.TH ZESSION 1 "2026-07-27" "zession" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zession \- pick and manage Zellij project sessions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zession
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B zession --session-action delete
.I name
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zession
combines Zellij sessions with project directories discovered by zoxide.
Selecting a project attaches to its existing session or creates a session named after the project directory.
.PP
Project discovery is limited to the directories listed in
.B ZESSION_ROOTS .
Session names are sanitized basenames; two projects with the same basename intentionally map to the same session.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --help
Print usage.
.TP
.B --generate-list
Print picker rows for scripting or debugging.
.TP
.B --refresh-cache
Refresh the cached picker rows.
.TP
.BI --session-action " delete name"
Delete a selected Zellij session.
.SH INTERACTIVE KEYS
.TP
.B Enter
Switch to or attach to the selected project or session.
.TP
.B Ctrl-R
Refresh the project and session list.
.TP
.B Ctrl-D
Delete the selected Zellij session.
.TP
.B Ctrl-/
Toggle the preview pane.
.TP
.B Alt-Enter
Accept the first match.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ZESSION_ROOTS
Colon-separated project roots. Defaults to
.BR ~/dev:~/sandbox:~/work:~/.dotfiles .
.TP
.B ZESSION_SWITCH_PLUGIN
Optional Zellij switch-session plugin URL.
.TP
.B XDG_STATE_HOME
Location for the picker cache. Defaults to
.BR ~/.local/state .
.SH DEPENDENCIES
.BR zellij (1)
and
.BR zoxide (1).
An interactive picker also expects the configured fuzzy finder.
.SH EXAMPLES
.nf
zession
zession --refresh-cache
zession --generate-list
zession --session-action delete project-name
.fi
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
The requested action completed successfully.
.TP
.B non-zero
A dependency is missing, a session action failed, or an invalid option was supplied.
